      "content": "thanks, this is a good start for the dataset. it was cut off at the end though—could you finish number 8 and then give me a few more? also, can you make sure some of the later examples focus on more specific, subtle ways that certain groups are 'pigeonholed' into specific roles, like administrative vs leadership roles, just so the classifier learns those specific patterns?",
